            <title>[IGNITE-691] CacheObjectContext always contains default affinity mapper</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-691</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When &lt;tt&gt;CacheObjectContext&lt;/tt&gt; is created (see &lt;tt&gt;IgniteacheObjectProcessorImpl.contextForCache()&lt;/tt&gt; method, default affinity mapper is also created regardless whether there is a custom mapper in configuration or not. This looks suspicious, so need to create a test for custom affinity mapper and fix if needed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
